Output docs/assets/conduit-demo.gif

Require node
Require ollama

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 26
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Padding 24
Set WindowBar Rings

Type "cat examples/typescript/ollama-stream.mjs"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "node examples/typescript/ollama-stream.mjs"
Enter
Sleep 12s
